LinkMai changes relative to the upstream project include a Chinese-language
interface and dictionary, the LinkMai product identity, package, environment
variable, and service names, LinkMai-specific deployment templates for
Alibaba Cloud, and an in-progress LinkMai marketing site. Upstream database
objects renamed to `linkmai_*` are upgraded in place by
`backend/migrations/20261125_01_rename_workflow_catalog.sql`; the historic
migrations that created the old names are left untouched.

The LinkMai name, logo, and marketing site content are not part of the
upstream project and are not covered by its copyright.
